// kiripanel: startup script for engines that do not load plugin\*.tpm by
// themselves. Run the game with  -startup=<this file>  (KiriKiri Z only):
// it links the tpm, then runs the game's own startup.tjs as usual.
// Nothing in the game folder is changed.
var kiripanel_mark = function(step, msg = "")
{
	if (typeof global.kiripanel_startup_probe == "undefined")
		return;
	var d = %[];
	d.step = step;
	d.msg = msg;
	(Dictionary.saveStruct incontextof d)(System.dataPath + "_kpstart_" + step + ".ksd", "");
} incontextof global;
kiripanel_mark("1-ran");
try
{
	var kp = System.exePath + "plugin/kiripanel.tpm";
	var have = Storages.isExistentStorage(kp);
	kiripanel_mark("1b-found", "" + have + " " + kp);
	if (typeof global.KiriPanelNative == "undefined" && have)
		Plugins.link(kp);
	kiripanel_mark("2-linked", typeof global.KiriPanelNative);
}
catch(e)
{
	kiripanel_mark("2-linkfailed", e.message);
	Debug.message("kiripanel: could not link the tpm: " + e.message);
}
kiripanel_mark("3-game");
Scripts.execStorage("startup.tjs");
